    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOffers in Excess of 449,000.\n\n\nA large bright spacious 4 bedroom detached bungalow with fabulous living space that is ready to move into straight away.\n\nThe property is situated within a six minute drive from the pretty village of Ballymurn with its pub, national school, church and garage with well stocked shop. Both Wexford Town and Enniscorthy are within a fifteen minute drive and the N11 to Dublin is within east access.\n\nAccommodation includes a large living room, super kitchen/dining, large sunroom, utility room, 4 bedrooms (main ensuite) a family bathroom and a large detached garage.\nThe gardens are mature, well planted and easily managed.\nIf you are looking for \"a ready to move into\", family home with generous living accommodation, \"Le Cappelle\" might be the property for you.\n\nPlease ring Abbie or MJ to book in a viewing.\n."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.87m x 1.96m\nBright and spacious.\n\nHall - 7.1m x 1.08m\n\n\nLiving Room - 5.6m x 5.56m\nFabulous room for entertaining, with solid fuel stove, downlighters, bay-window and double door access into the kitchen / dining area.\n\nOpen Plan Kitchen - Living Area - 7.56m x 4.12m\nKitchen and entire has tiled flooring and splashbacks, waist and eye level storage units and \"island\".Opens up into the large sunroom.\n\nSunroom - 4.54m x 3.9m\nLarge extra living area with fabulous views of the country side.\n\nUtility Room - 3.3m x 2m\nWith fitted storage, tiled flooring and splash backs and plumbed for a washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 2.7m\n\n\nHot Press - \n\n\nBathroom - 4.3m x 1.95m\nRecently updated and fully tiled with mains shower, bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 2 Ensuite - 5.5m x 4.13m\nWith walk in storage.\n\nEnsuite - \nRecently updated and fully tiled with Triton T90 Electric Shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.62m x 2.96m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.28m x 3m\n\n\nDetached Garage - 5.64m x 3.5m\nfabulous addition to any home.\n\n"
      },
